@startuml cgms_sensor_if
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

title CGMS Sensor Interface (Updated)

component "Enzyme Electrode" as Electrode
component "Temperature Sensor" as Temp
component "Analog Front End (AFE)" as AFE
component "ADC" as ADC
component "MCU / Firmware" as MCU
component "Power Monitor" as Power
component "On-Device Diagnostics" as Diag

' --------------------
' Primary sensing path
' --------------------
Electrode --> AFE : glucose-dependent current (nA)
AFE --> ADC : conditioned voltage
ADC --> MCU : digital samples

' --------------------
' Environmental compensation
' --------------------
Temp --> MCU : temperature (°C)

' --------------------
' Power & health
' --------------------
Power --> MCU : battery level / brownout
AFE --> Diag : saturation / noise metrics
ADC --> Diag : clipping / timing errors
MCU --> Diag : signal quality metrics

note right of AFE
AFE Functions:
- Transimpedance amplifier
- Noise filtering
- Factory gain calibration
(No user calibration)
end note

note right of MCU
Firmware Responsibilities:
- Temperature compensation
- Signal conditioning
- Sampling control (power-aware)
- Data validation
end note

note right of Diag
Diagnostics Scope:
- Electrode degradation
- Signal saturation
- Temperature out-of-range
- Power anomalies
end note

note bottom of Power
Single-use battery:
- Non-rechargeable
- Finite energy budget
end note

@enduml

